## Summary of Changes:

**Desktop.vue:**
- Removed `autoSaveTimeout` and `currentViewName` from data
- Removed `activeProject` watcher and `onActiveProjectChange` method
- Removed all view-related methods (`autoSaveCurrentView`, `onActiveProjectChange`, `saveLayout`)
- Changed `debouncedAutoSave` to `saveLayoutImmediately` - saves to localStorage instantly on every change
- Removed exposed methods: `saveLayout`, `setCurrentViewName`
- Simplified component to auto-save on every panel add/remove/layout change

**ui.js store:**
- Removed all state properties related to views: `views`, `lastView`, `currentViewName`
- Removed all view-related mutations and actions: `loadViews`, `saveView`, `loadView`, `deleteView`, `renameView`, `restoreLatestView`, `restoreLastView`, `persistLastView`, `resetDesktop`
- Kept all other functionality intact

